\newlabel{fig:extraction-wer}{{3}{5}{Median WER vs.\ overlap ratio for baseline (no extraction), hybrid loss ($\alpha = 0.1$), and power-law reconstruction loss only ($\alpha = 0$) at 0\,dB SIR (left) and 5\,dB SIR (right). Both extraction models reduce WER at overlap ratios $\geq 0.3$, with the largest gains at full overlap}{figure.3}{}}
